config PAGECTL
	tristate "Deferred page dirtying controller"
	depends on BLOCK
	help
	  Build a filesystem-independent controller for delayed dirtying of
	  native page-cache folios and buffer heads.  Filesystems can use its
	  exported APIs to keep modified pages out of the normal dirty-page
	  index until an explicit release decision hands them back to Linux.
	  Deferred memory is pinned and has no automatic pressure writeback.
